WEBVTT

NOTE
Very brief dramatic moment. Squall lands on the parade float and encounters Seifer, who now stands as Edea's knight and protector. A moment of shock and realization as allies become enemies. Duration: approximately 6 seconds.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
Squall's eyes widen as he takes in the scene before him. Seifer Almasy stands defiantly on the parade float, positioned directly in front of Sorceress Edea. His grey trench coat flares around him. His gunblade is drawn and ready.

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Seifer's expression is fierce and triumphant. A sadistic smile plays at his lips. His eyes gleam with resolve and pride. Behind him, Edea stands imperious and commanding, her horned headdress towering above. The dynamic is clear: Seifer is her willing servant and protector.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Squall and Seifer lock eyes. The tension is electric. The realization strikes Squall like a physical blow: Seifer has chosen to stand with the Sorceress. Former allies are now enemies. The assassination mission has transformed into direct combat.
